    (date "2026-11-19")
    (rev "1.0")
    (company "Redrawn from Autek Research QF-1 manual")
    (comment 1 "U101 TL071 replaces uA741; Q101/Q102 BC337/BC327 replace MPS6560/MPS6562")
    (comment 2 "Mains transformer, ON-OFF switch and line caps C107/C108 are off-board")
    (comment 3 "Bridge D102-D105 accepts 12-15 VAC (original: centre-tapped secondary, 2 diodes)")
    (comment 4 "Dashed box = chassis boundary. H101 pad = direct RF ground to chassis screw")
